	(text "Proposal. Not built, not validated on hardware.\nLow voltage only: 5 V to 24 V DC. No mains on any terminal, trace or header.\nSpec: terminal-controller/spec/SPEC.md. Header map: spec/pins.yaml.\nCross-sheet nets use global labels: I2C_SDA, I2C_SCL, X0.0 to X0.7, X1.0 to X1.7,\nARM, AUDIO_PWM, UART_TX, UART_RX, BTN_*, GPIOn. Rails use power symbols."
